          "annotations": [],
          "text": "{\"lean_source\":\"namespace Pipeline.Generated\\n\\ndef lineCount (stdin : List String) : Nat :=\\n  stdin.length\\n\\ndef renderCount (n : Nat) : String :=\\n  toString n\\n\\ndef run (args stdin : List String) : List String \u00d7 UInt32 :=\\n  ([renderCount (lineCount stdin)], (0 : UInt32))\\n\\ntheorem run_output_shape (args stdin : List String) :\\n    (run args stdin).1.length = 1 := by\\n  rfl\\n\\ntheorem run_output_bound (args stdin : List String) :\\n    (run args stdin).1.length \u2264 1 := by\\n  simp [run]\\n\\ntheorem run_output_content (args stdin : List String) :\\n    (run args stdin).1 = [toString stdin.length] := by\\n  rfl\\n\\ntheorem run_exit_code (args stdin : List String) :\\n    (run args stdin).2 = (0 : UInt32) := by\\n  rfl\\n\\ntheorem run_idempotent_empty_append (args stdin : List String) :\\n    run args (stdin ++ []) = run args stdin := by\\n  simp [run, lineCount, renderCount]\\n\\nend Pipeline.Generated\",\"spec_theorems\":[{\"name\":\"run_output_shape\",\"informal\":\"With the -l slice, execution produces exactly one stdout line.\"},{\"name\":\"run_output_bound\",\"informal\":\"The stdout output has length at most one line.\"},{\"name\":\"run_output_content\",\"informal\":\"The sole output line is the decimal representation of the number of input lines.\"},{\"name\":\"run_exit_code\",\"informal\":\"Successful completion returns exit code zero.\"},{\"name\":\"run_idempotent_empty_append\",\"informal\":\"Appending no input lines does not change the result.\"}]}",
          "type": "output_text",
